<<<
Diphtheria, diphthong, & their derivatives, are sometimes misspelt, & very often mispronounced, the first -h- being neglected; difthis the right sound, & dipth- a vulgarism. diploma.
===
*Diphtheria, diphthong,* & their derivatives, are sometimes misspelt, & very often mispronounced, the first *-h-* being neglected; *dĭfth-* is the right sound, & *dĭpth-* a vulgarism.

**diploma.**
>>>

<<<
The pl. is always -mas in the ordinary senses (certificate of degree &c.), though -mata lingers in unusual senses (State paper &c.) as an alternative.
===
